# ==============================================================================
# WorkTree AI Docker Ignore File
# ==============================================================================
# Essential for preventing Windows host node_modules, .next, and .venv from
# corrupting Linux container file systems during build.

# 1. Dependency Trees & Environments
node_modules
**/node_modules
.venv
**/.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc

# 2. Build Outputs & Caches
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
build
out
**/out
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
target
**/target
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
.turbo

# 3. Local Databases, Audio Spools & State
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.opus
.worktree
**/.worktree

# 4. Version Control & OS Files
.git
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
